  {view==='map'&&<><div className='cos-fleet-workspace'>{!boardOn&&<section className='cos-fleet-unit-panel' aria-label='Fleet units in view'>{fieldInventory&&boardData&&filters.placement==='field'&&filters.family==='all'&&filters.provider==='all'&&!filters.nearbyId&&filters.layer==='camera'?<><div><h2>Field equipment <b>{fieldInventory.total}</b></h2><small>Customer · service address · saved status</small></div><div className='cos-fleet-unit-list'><FleetFieldProductList onVerified={verificationReadback} rows={rows} now={snapshotNow} products={boardData.items} status={filters.status} query={filters.query} onOpen={product=>{if(product.linked?.unitId)open(product.linked.unitId);else if(product.linked?.recordId)openSource(product.linked.recordId);else if(mhelpAddresses&&[...mhelpAddresses.pins,...mhelpAddresses.reviews].some(p=>p.productId===product.productId))openMhelpAddress(product.productId);else show('Product '+product.productId+' has no verified COS unit or saved address. Review Data sources.');}}/></div><details className='cos-fleet-diagnostic-records'><summary>Connection / map records ({filtered.length+filteredSource.length})</summary><p>These are diagnostic representations of equipment, not additional inventory. Identity and lifecycle holds can exclude records here without removing their authoritative Field placement above. Map filters below affect this subset and its pins.</p>{filtersPanel}{mapEquipmentList}</details></>:<><div><h2>{recorded.roster?'Connection / map records':'Units in view'} <b>{filtered.length+filteredSource.length}</b></h2><small>{recorded.roster?'Diagnostic subset · not the complete Field Product-ID inventory':'UNIT / SITE · CAM / RTR / BAT'}</small></div>{filtersPanel}{mapEquipmentList}</>}</section>}<ViewErrorBoundary fallback={retry => (
    <section className="cos-fleet-message" role="alert">
      <p>The map couldn’t display. Fleet counts and equipment are still available.</p>
      <button type="button" onClick={retry}>Retry map</button>
    </section>
  )}><Suspense fallback={<p role='status'>Loading the map…</p>}><FleetDashboardMap rows={filtered} stageRows={rows} stageRead={{at:Number.isFinite(snapshotNow)?new Date(snapshotNow).toISOString():null,failed:Boolean(failed)}
